<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mxfile host="drawio" version="26.0.0">
  <diagram name="loop-selection">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" page="1" pageWidth="1660" pageHeight="1950" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="ttl" value="Choosing a loop" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0f3355;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="600" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Work down from the lightest loop and stop at the first that fits. By risk surface, not diff size. Escalation climbs one-way and never de-escalates." style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4a7095;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="1100" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="entry" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;a change to implement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#0f3355;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="130" width="320" height="46" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;single-player Unity change?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;no networking, multiplayer, online services,&lt;br&gt;accounts, purchases, analytics or personal data,&lt;br&gt;downloaded or user-generated content,&lt;br&gt;mod loading or credentials&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="480" height="180" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;all of these hold?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;one project, roughly five files or fewer ·&lt;br&gt;no authn/authz, secrets or untrusted input ·&lt;br&gt;no migration, schema, generated artifact&lt;br&gt;or public contract change · no concurrency&lt;br&gt;or transaction-boundary change ·&lt;br&gt;no new dependency · easy to roll back&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="490" width="480" height="220" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;any of these?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;auth, secrets or untrusted input ·&lt;br&gt;migration, schema or public API contract ·&lt;br&gt;more than one project · hard to roll back&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="480" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;expensive to miss?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;payment, billing, money or goods ·&lt;br&gt;auth, permissions, tenant data isolation ·&lt;br&gt;a migration that alters or destroys data ·&lt;br&gt;an integration contract others depend on ·&lt;br&gt;slow or costly rollback · code you are&lt;br&gt;handing over and will not maintain&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="480" height="230" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;severe and largely irreversible?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;a migration destroying production data ·&lt;br&gt;tenant isolation exposing others' data ·&lt;br&gt;money movement with a regulatory consequence ·&lt;br&gt;a contract other organisations build against ·&lt;br&gt;code going to someone who cannot fix it&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1260" width="480" height="230" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_entry_d0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entry" target="d0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d0_d1" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d0" target="d1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d1_d2" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d1" target="d2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d2_d3" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d2" target="d3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d3_d4" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d3" target="d4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ultralight" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-ultralight&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;1 reviewer, 9-item sweep (Sonnet) · 1 round&lt;br&gt;single implementation handoff · no verification · ~0.1×&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="562" width="400" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lite" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-lite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;4 consolidated lanes (3 Sonnet, 1 Haiku) · 2 rounds&lt;br&gt;verify after a Critical · ~0.3×&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="807" width="400" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="full" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;the default · 9 gated lanes (4 Opus, 5 Sonnet) · 3 rounds&lt;br&gt;verify when risky · 1×&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1057" width="400" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ultra" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-ultra&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;9 lanes × 3 (opposed pair + adjudicator) · 3 rounds&lt;br&gt;reviewer tiers as full, ×3 · always verify · ~3×&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1337" width="400" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="opus" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-ultra-opus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;9 lanes × 3, every reviewer Opus xhigh · 3 rounds&lt;br&gt;sidekick-heavy implements · always verify · ~8×&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1532" width="400" height="76" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d1_ul" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d1" target="ultralight"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d2_lite" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d2" target="lite"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d3_full" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d3" target="full"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d4_ultra" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d4" target="ultra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d4_opus" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d4" target="opus"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.8" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="280" y="1570" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_ul_lite" value="any other Major ·&lt;br&gt;more than four accepted findings ·&lt;br&gt;a reviewer could not cover a concern" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=left;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ultralight" target="lite"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_lite_full" value="any Critical in round 1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=left;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lite" target="full"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_full_ultra" value="a Critical in a lane the change was not&lt;br&gt;expected to touch, or the same Critical&lt;br&gt;surviving a fix and recurring" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=left;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="full" target="ultra"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_ultra_opus" value="an adjudicator reports coverage: both thin&lt;br&gt;on a lane owning a Critical, twice" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=left;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ultra" target="opus"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_ul_full" value="any Critical, or a Major in&lt;br&gt;security, architecture&lt;br&gt;or concurrency" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=left;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ultralight" target="full"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1070" y="600" /><mxPoint x="1070" y="1095" /></Array><mxPoint x="8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zone" value="SINGLE-PLAYER UNITY" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#f1f3f6;strokeColor=#c9c9c9;fontColor=#4a7095;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="190" width="500" height="522" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ud" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;contained?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;one system or one scene ·&lt;br&gt;no settings, pipeline, package or asmdef change ·&lt;br&gt;no save-format change · no new shared&lt;br&gt;primitive · no new art direction&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="zone"><mxGeometry x="60" y="30" width="360" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="unitylite" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-unity-lite&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;the contained single-player change&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="zone"><mxGeometry x="115" y="280" width="250" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="unity" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-unity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;everything else single-player&lt;br&gt;no heavier Unity loop: the same Critical&lt;br&gt;surviving a fix stops the run and reports&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="zone"><mxGeometry x="115" y="426" width="250" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_d0_ud" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d0" target="ud"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.8" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ud_ulite" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;labelBackgroundColor=#f1f3f6;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ud" target="unitylite"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ud_unity" value="no" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;labelBackgroundColor=#f1f3f6;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ud" target="unity"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1575" y="320" /><mxPoint x="1575" y="661" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_ulite_unity" value="any Critical in round 1, or the&lt;br&gt;change turns out to need art&lt;br&gt;direction, a settings change,&lt;br&gt;or a new primitive" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;align=right;labelBackgroundColor=#f1f3f6;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="unitylite" target="unity"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc_zone_d1" value="single-player eligibility breaks mid-run → the general ladder" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5c6b85;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7a8399;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.4981;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="zone" target="d1"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="400.0" y="450" /></Array><mxPoint x="0" y="-12" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;When unsure, go heavier.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;The savings never justify a missed Critical.&lt;br&gt;But the cost column matters: ultra is ~3× a full run,&lt;br&gt;ultra-opus ~8×. Reaching past the point where extra&lt;br&gt;scrutiny changes the outcome is spending, not&lt;br&gt;diligence. The honest default for most work is /dev-loop.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1668" width="420" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Escalation is one-way, mandatory, and never de-escalates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;ultralight → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop&lt;/b&gt; on any Critical, or a Major in security, architecture or concurrency&lt;br&gt;ultralight → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop-lite&lt;/b&gt; on any other Major, more than four accepted findings, or a reviewer reporting it could not cover a concern&lt;br&gt;lite → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop&lt;/b&gt; on any Critical in round 1&lt;br&gt;full → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop-ultra&lt;/b&gt; on a Critical in a lane the change was not expected to touch, or the same Critical surviving a fix and recurring&lt;br&gt;ultra → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop-ultra-opus&lt;/b&gt; when an adjudicator reports coverage: both thin on a lane owning a Critical, twice&lt;br&gt;dev-loop-unity-lite → &lt;b&gt;dev-loop-unity&lt;/b&gt; on any Critical in round 1, or when the change needs art direction, a settings change, or a new primitive&lt;br&gt;either Unity loop → &lt;b&gt;the general ladder&lt;/b&gt; if single-player eligibility breaks mid-run&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f7dadd;strokeColor=#9e2b34;fontColor=#5a1a1f;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1668" width="1130" height="160" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="escN" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Never fix and carry on. A change that produced a Critical was misjudged, and the concerns the lighter loop compressed have not had proper attention.&lt;br&gt;Escalating from dev-loop upward is rarer than escalating into it, and is stated to the user with the cost, not taken silently.&lt;br&gt;Implementation and the orchestrator are never downgraded: the first four loops write and fix code at the same tiers and differ only in review depth; dev-loop-ultra-opus alone raises implementation to Opus.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#b8b8b8;fontColor=#4a4a4a;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1848" width="1580" height="62" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
